cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use claude-workstation in your work, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
title: "claude-workstation: a tmux + Claude Code workstation for WSL2"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible developer workstation for WSL2 that runs many Claude Code sessions in tmux, with per-tab state and
  timing, model routing, local telemetry and reports, remote control over Telegram, protection levels and parallel
  agents in git worktrees.
authors:
  - alias: andreshma
version: 3.0.1
date-released: 2026-11-25
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/andreshma/claude-workstation"
url: "https://github.com/andreshma/claude-workstation"
keywords: [claude-code, tmux, wsl2, developer-experience, telemetry, devops]
